<title>SWEDEN: Volvo 9-mo truck sales fall 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Volvo 9-mo truck sales fall 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish automotive group AB Volvo said on Tuesday sales of its truck division had fallen 16 percent in the first nine months of the year to 47,400.</p>
<p>Volvo Truck spokesman Stefan Lorentzson told Reuters the total U.S. Truck market was expected to contract by between 10 and 12 percent next year.</p>
<p>However he said the European truck market was seen remaining remain strong in 1997.</p>
</text>
